**ACL Management Workflow:**

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant PR as Pull Request
    participant Terraform as Terraform
    participant Kafka as MSK Cluster
    participant Lenses as Lenses.io

    Dev->>PR: Submit ACL change (Terraform)
    PR->>Terraform: Automated policy validation
    PR->>PR: Security team approval required
    PR->>Terraform: Merge triggers CI/CD
    Terraform->>Kafka: Apply ACL via kafka_acl resource
    Kafka->>Lenses: ACL change detected
    Lenses->>Lenses: Update RBAC UI
    Lenses->>Dev: ACL change notification
```

**IAM Authentication Flow:**

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application (EKS)
    participant IRSA as IAM Role (IRSA)
    participant STS as AWS STS
    participant MSK as MSK Broker
    participant IAM as AWS IAM

    App->>IRSA: Assume role via service account
    IRSA->>STS: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
    STS->>App: Temporary credentials
    App->>MSK: Kafka connection (SASL_SSL/AWS_MSK_IAM)
    MSK->>IAM: Validate credentials + policy
    IAM->>MSK: Authorization decision
    MSK->>App: Connection established
```

